{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get ready for an all-new RETRO style gaming experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176510/extras/1d635a3617e9858472ea2729bb2d1d60.avif?t=1761098521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176510/extras_big/1d635a3617e9858472ea2729bb2d1d60.webp?t=1761098521 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jrago The Demon Hunter is an indie METROIDVANIA style 2D Platforming Action-Adventure Role Playing Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is overcome in darkness, and you are a hunter named Jrago on a quest to slay the demons and bring back the light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176510/extras/d7d09b6910b039cad0fab0ea76eaba3f.avif?t=1761098521\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Featuring an original soundtrack by &quot;Jrago&quot; the band of the same name, and a whole host of unlockable weapons, armor, magic spells, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176510/extras/08620245e8d0b1543fc8849daf35be27.avif?t=1761098521\" width=126 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">30-40 Hours of Gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">51 Unlockable achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Classic blue-squared mapping system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An expansive world divided up into 10 Chapters and 26 Boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the first game developed by Jrago Studios, a solo indie developer based in USA.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demon Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/0bdf788968f5738d1b1e49fb0e02c7ea73713935.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Eliminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/ab2bd1aea818f1df7bc4e6931578d2ef527fea2f.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/227fe310f027459bd762379f1c988dc410da9e55.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/5e7e5554c5f8f2360e64c0f94ebcda69f2eb1070.jpg"},{"name":"Demon Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/b9fa70b839729443e5f83997807e999ef09fa38f.jpg"},{"name":"Official Hunter Gear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/856c4b1d96c503d17abf209a446f3172ef17ba5e.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed Sword of Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/6088439c9fa99c83e2f325714534776dcc356401.jpg"},{"name":"Wielder of the Legendary Blade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/da4815564165fd1617ec8bd9b951abe3dfc87c42.jpg"},{"name":"The Sword In The Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/dd5ed8f3e78ecb28741e34d718f887b9a503f5d9.jpg"},{"name":"Sword of the Spirit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2176510/ede62996d9f8a607145e0fa7ef92db555cfc67a0.jpg"}],"total":51},"background":